the measurement of the tests' external processes (#542)\n\nThis reverts commit 7b5aaefe3b07b7f15d7830e78897d535e3458364, the temporary\nwrapper ahead of PATH and the summary step, as its message said. Its run on the\n9700X (job 122120861141) logged 12,599 processes of 204.8 s of CPU, of the\nstep's 401.5 s; clang's were 175.8 s. The largest users: test-preprocessor's\ncases (50.9 s, 6,118 runs, the predefines' 2,829 among them), the call-graph\ncheck's captures (40.1 s, out of scope), test-calling-convention (27.0 s),\ntest-checker (21.5 s, 776 runs) and test-tier0 (10.8 s). The tests that take\nclang as /usr/bin/clang (test-checker-corpus, test-c-testsuite's oracle,\n--compare-clang) bypassed the wrapper. The wrapper also failed\ntest-differential-harness, which resolves clang through realpath to the\nwrapper's own name.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_015wfSYSTxpRcg75TEGpGsVX\nSigned-off-by: David Gonzalez Martin <davidgmbb@gmail.com>","timestamp":"2026-10-27T11:08:58Z","author":{"name":"Claude","email":"noreply@anthropic.com"},"committer":{"name":"Claude","email":"noreply@anthropic.com"}},"repository":{"id":1421805693,"node_id":"R_kgDOVL8IfQ","name":"buster","full_name":"buster14a/buster","private":false,"owner":{"login":"buster14a","id":139068652,"node_id":"O_kgDOCEoE7A","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/139068652?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/buster14a","html_url":"https://github.com/buster14a","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/buster14a/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/buster14a/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/buster14a/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/buster14a/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/buster14a/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/buster14a/orgs","repos_url":"https: